{"text":"正光五年三月廿六日，比丘尼道□敬造釋迦像一區。□為七世〔父母〕、所生父母、亡兄弟□□□□，託生西方□□□□□□淨之處，□□□諸佛。願一切眾〔生〕□□佛道。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":17,"end":19},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":45,"end":47},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"西方","refId":null,"text":"西方","start":47,"end":49}]}